            "en": "Downward sum: (-1.5)(-2) + 6(4) + (-3)(3) = 3 + 24 - 9 = 18"
          },
          {
            "en": "Upward sum: 6(3) + (-3)(-2) + (-1.5)(4) = 18 + 6 - 6 = 18"
          },
          {
            "en": "Area = 1/2 (18 - 18) = 0, so the points are collinear"
          }
        ],
        "commonMisconceptions": [
